WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — rce-jepa (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:10.074
<v Narrator>Ni akọkọ, niwọn igba ti o ba jẹ pe ọrọ-ọrọ ko si ọrọ-ọrọ, awọn awoṣe kekere ṣe akiyesi awọn akojọpọ ti o ni itumọ ti eto.

2
00:00:10.154 --> 00:00:19.693
<v Narrator>Keji, eyikeyi AI awoṣe le ṣe iṣeduro kan candidate program, ṣugbọn a iyara, ti o dara ju checker yan ohun ti o kọja.

3
00:00:19.773 --> 00:00:26.990
<v Narrator>O ni awọn ohun elo ti o pọju ju awọn ọgọrun-un lọ, ati pe o jẹ ki o rọrun lati ṣe ayẹwo.
